  "limitations": [
    "Flat compounds rows themselves carry no medium or solution ID. Joining by row content alone is nonunique.",
    "The selected parent is reconstructed from frozen generation values and producer contract at the frozen KG revision; this is not an assertion that the file contains a literal parent field or that every occurrence was reviewed.",
    "The full production acquisition/SQLite-cache validator is not executed by this script; it checks manifest-pinned body values, latest ledger selection and pure extraction replay without deserializing caches.",
    "MediaDive ingredient ID identifies a deduplicated ingredient; the selected first recipe supplies the flattened source_record. This is not a census of all recipes or an approval of all records bearing the same spelling.",
    "Current official provider pages/PDF require a separate capture and comparison; the original REST body date is preserved.",
    "No inherited WITHHOLD, alias-payload, rejected-tombstone, source-specific, publication or integration gate is lifted."
  ]
